           class="card-img-top"
           alt="Banner image for [Podcast] Canonical Cache Representation article.">
    </a>
    <div class="card-body">
      <a href="https://blog.apnic.net/2026/08/06/podcast-canonical-cache-representation/">
        <h5 class="card-title">[Podcast] Canonical Cache Representation</h5>
      </a>
      <div class="card-text">
        <p>By George Michaelson</p>
        <p>Job Snijders discusses a new, compact representation of RPKI-signed objects and an archive of spooled snapshots of the global RPKI repositories.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
